f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows February to March came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025, October to November ran 66% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 59% on the middle of the grids. Grid 32867 had its driest year in 2000 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
